計者不攻周。攻周，實不足以利，聲畏天下。天下以聲畏秦，必東合於齊。兵獘於周。合天下於齊，則秦不王矣。天下欲獘秦，勸王攻周。秦與天下獘，則令不行矣。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m082-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"周君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m082-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"秦客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m082-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"周最","kind":"person","person_id":"q2r_2vh_ic0","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m082-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"秦王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m082-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"太后","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m082-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"秦王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m082-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"周君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m082-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"周君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m082-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"周聚","kind":"person","person_id":"kxs_sv8_cbe","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m082-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"秦王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-004","source_i